joi|n|Moisture from the atmosphere condensed by cool bodies upon their surfaces, particularly at night. ; Figuratively, anything which falls lightly and in a refreshing manner. ; An emblem of morning, or fresh vigor. ; Same as Due, or Duty.	a:h0i,85,5~h0i,85,5	v:1axq,51,1~1axq,51,1	V:1jvx,2,1~1jvx,2,1	n:1axq,71,4;1b3k,32,1;72a,28,4~1axq,71,4;72a,28,4;1b3k,32,1	N:1jvx,27,6;297r,24,1;1695,13,3~1jvx,27,6;1695,13,3;297r,24,1
